  "title": "Lentil Loaf",
  "description": "A perfect dinner loaf, but would also would make great open-face sandwiches for lunch. This recipe is easy and after you&#39;ve cooked the lentils, everything else is stirred into the pot, and transferred to a loaf pan to bake.",
